{"id":"n20219-3-5","stage":1,"title":"봄 · 春天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20219-3-5-1","ko":"오늘 그 사람을 만날 생각을 하니 벌써부터 설렌다.","zh":"想到今天要见那个人，我已经开始心动了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"他","explanation":"그：他","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람을","audio":"/audio/e4ea86ef494eafea0006.mp3"}},{"text":"만날","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만날","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3"}},{"text":"생각을","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각을","audio":"/audio/922a3a2cfe41b93c64d0.mp3"}},{"text":"하니","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써부터","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써부터","audio":"/audio/23ff8caf94dc3d12e2b1.mp3"}},{"text":"설렌다.","meaning":"起伏，澎湃，激动","explanation":"설레다：起伏，澎湃，激动；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"설레다","audio":"/audio/37f7c107f270bac96548.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62645","senseId":"1","lemma":"설레다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설렌다","audio":"/audio/3bd4df2add587e762353.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"他","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代对话双方以外的人。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示想法或推测。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示想法或推测。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"37f7c107f270bac9","term":"설레다","zh":"起伏，澎湃，激动","audio":"/audio/37f7c107f270bac96548.mp3","entryId":"62645","definition":"心里不平静、浮躁，心怦怦跳。","pronunciation":["설레다"]}],"audio":"/audio/28c1e562def147009d55.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20219-3-5-2","ko":"너 요새 완전히 봄이구나.","zh":"你最近完全沉浸在恋爱的春天里了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"요새","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}},{"text":"완전히","meaning":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","explanation":"완전히：完全地，完美地，彻底地","readings":[{"term":"완전히","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67847","senseId":"1","lemma":"완전히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"완전히","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3"}},{"text":"봄이구나.","meaning":"春天，美好时光","explanation":"봄：春天，美好时光；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20219","senseId":"3","lemma":"봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봄이구나","audio":"/audio/e7b7ee2a4d5cc9f5a6a3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"2e1177912c702a7a","term":"요새","zh":"近来，日来，最近","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3","entryId":"67864","definition":"从不久前到现在的非常短的期间。","pronunciation":["요새"]},{"id":"b38cc705c97aaddc","term":"완전히","zh":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3","entryId":"67847","definition":"没有不足之处，具备完整无缺没有